Package: replication.faircoop
Title: Equitable Cooperation Deepens the Solution Space for High Ambition Pathways
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Setu", "Pelz", email = "pelz@iiasa.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replication archive for the analysis of fair-share cooperation
    scenarios built with the MESSAGEix-GLOBIOM-GAINS integrated assessment
    model. Assembles per-scenario reporting workbooks into a single tidy
    dataset and generates all code-based manuscript and supplementary figures.
